+<header class="product-nav"><a class="product-wordmark" href="../../index.html">Priyansh Chordia <span>· iOS</span></a><nav aria-label="Product"><a href="../../index.html#work">Products</a><a href="#top">AuraFit</a><a href="#waitlist">Join waitlist</a></nav></header>
+<div id="top"><section class="product-hero"><div><p class="product-kicker">AuraFit</p><h1>An outfit check that stays on your phone.</h1><p class="product-hero-body">Capture or import a full-body photo and get a Fit Score for outfit, colour, pose, lighting, framing, and background — computed entirely on your iPhone. The photo never leaves the device.</p><p class="product-hero-note">In TestFlight beta — not on the App Store yet. AuraFit analyzes photos entirely on device with no account, backend, analytics, or tracking. The app has no networking code of its own, and every feature is free.</p><div class="product-actions"><a class="product-button" href="#waitlist">Join the waitlist</a><a href="#how-it-works">See how it works <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div></div><div class="product-motif" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><i></i><b></b></div></section>
+<section class="product-shots"><div class="product-section-heading"><p>The app</p><h2>Scan, score, share if you want.</h2></div><div class="product-shots-grid"><figure><div class="product-shot" aria-label="Scan screenshot placeholder"><span>Screenshot pending</span></div><figcaption>Scan</figcaption></figure><figure><div class="product-shot" aria-label="Fit Score screenshot placeholder"><span>Screenshot pending</span></div><figcaption>Fit Score</figcaption></figure><figure><div class="product-shot" aria-label="Coaching tips screenshot placeholder"><span>Screenshot pending</span></div><figcaption>Coaching tips</figcaption></figure><figure><div class="product-shot" aria-label="History screenshot placeholder"><span>Screenshot pending</span></div><figcaption>History</figcaption></figure></div></section>
+<section class="product-benefits"><div class="product-section-heading"><p>Why it exists</p><h2>Honest feedback, with nobody else looking.</h2></div><div class="product-triad"><article><span>01</span><h3>Scan the fit</h3><p>Capture or import a full-body photo and let on-device analysis read pose, palette, lighting, and framing.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Read the score</h3><p>See a weighted Fit Score with concrete tips for the outfit, the light, and the frame.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Share on your terms</h3><p>Export a scorecard or a five-second reveal clip only when you choose to.</p></article></div></section>
+<section id="how-it-works" class="product-steps"><div class="product-section-heading"><p>How it works</p><h2>Three steps before you head out.</h2></div><ol><li><span>01</span><p>Capture or import a full-body photo.</p></li><li><span>02</span><p>Review your Fit Score and coaching tips.</p></li><li><span>03</span><p>Save or share the scorecard if you want to.</p></li></ol></section>
+<section class="product-trust"><div><p>Privacy and trust</p><h2>Your mirror photos are yours alone.</h2><p>AuraFit analyzes photos entirely on device with no account, backend, analytics, or tracking. The app has no networking code of its own, and every feature is free.</p><div class="product-legal-links"><a href="../../apps/aurafit/privacy/">Privacy notice</a><a href="../../apps/aurafit/support/">Support</a></div></div><aside><p>Honest boundary</p><strong>Scores are subjective guidance about an outfit and a photograph; they never measure a person.</strong></aside></section>
+<section class="product-features"><div class="product-section-heading"><p>Feature highlights</p><h2>Everything in the beta build.</h2></div><dl><div><dt>Scan a full-body photo</dt><dd>01</dd></div><div><dt>Read the weighted Fit Score</dt><dd>02</dd></div><div><dt>Follow concrete tips</dt><dd>03</dd></div><div><dt>Keep a private history</dt><dd>04</dd></div><div><dt>On-device analysis only</dt><dd>05</dd></div><div><dt>Share only what you export</dt><dd>06</dd></div></dl></section>
+<section class="product-fit"><div class="product-section-heading"><p>Who the beta is for</p><h2>For people who check the fit before they leave.</h2></div><div><article><h3>A good fit if you</h3><p>For people who take a mirror check before heading out and want honest, private feedback.</p></article><article><h3>AuraFit is deliberately not</h3><p>Scores are subjective guidance about an outfit and a photograph; they never measure a person.</p></article></div></section>
+<section id="waitlist" class="product-waitlist"><div><p>Waitlist</p><h2>Ask for a TestFlight invitation.</h2><p>No account is created. Your email is stored only to send AuraFit beta invitations.</p></div><form data-waitlist="" data-app-name="AuraFit" action="mailto:support@priyanshchordia.com?subject=AuraFit%20beta" method="post"><label for="waitlist-email-aurafit">Email address <em>(required)</em><input id="waitlist-email-aurafit" type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@example.com" aria-describedby="waitlist-status-aurafit" required=""></label><label>First name <em>(optional)</em><input type="text" name="first_name" autocomplete="given-name"></label><label>Device and iOS version, or what you want to test <em>(optional)</em><textarea name="device" aria-describedby="device-hint"></textarea><small id="device-hint">Helps prioritise invitations across devices. Leave blank if you would rather not say.</small></label><label class="product-consent"><input id="waitlist-consent-aurafit" type="checkbox" name="consent" aria-describedby="waitlist-status-aurafit" required=""> Email me about TestFlight access and occasional updates for AuraFit. I can unsubscribe at any time.</label><button class="product-button" type="submit">Join the AuraFit waitlist</button><p id="waitlist-status-aurafit" class="waitlist-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" tabindex="-1"></p><p class="waitlist-fallback">The signup service is not connected yet. Email <a href="mailto:support@priyanshchordia.com?subject=AuraFit%20beta">support@priyanshchordia.com</a> with the subject “AuraFit beta” and you will be added by hand.</p></form></section>
+<section class="product-faq"><div class="product-section-heading"><p>Questions and limits</p><h2>What the score is, and what it is not.</h2></div><details><summary>Can I download AuraFit from the App Store?</summary><p>No. AuraFit is in TestFlight beta and is not available on the App Store yet.</p></details><details><summary>How soon will I get an invitation?</summary><p>Invitations are sent in small groups as testing capacity opens. There is no queue position or promised timeline.</p></details><details><summary>What do you do with my email address?</summary><p>It is used only to send beta invitations and occasional updates. You can ask to be removed at any time.</p></details><div class="product-limits"><p>Honest limitations</p><strong>Scores are subjective guidance about an outfit and a photograph; they never measure a person.</strong></div></section>
