+<body><a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a><div class="wrap">
+<header class="top"><div class="left">
+
+<a class="brand" href="../../../index.html">P/C <span class="status" aria-hidden="true">●</span></a></div>
+<nav aria-label="Primary"><a href="../../../index.html#work">Work</a><a class="active" aria-current="page" href="../../../apps/">App URLs</a><a href="../../../journal/">Journal</a></nav></header>
+<main id="main"><section><article class="post legal"><span class="label">Privacy / Mala</span>
+<h1>Mala privacy policy</h1><p class="policy-date">Draft updated July 29, 2026</p><h2>The short version</h2><p>Mala is a local-first repetition-practice app. It has no account, ads, analytics, tracking, third-party SDKs, or developer-operated network service.</p><h2>Information stored on your device</h2><p>Mala stores the practice labels you create, your preferences, an in-progress practice, and practice history in the app's local storage. This information is used only to provide the app's features and is not sent to the developer.</p><h2>Your choices</h2><p>You can delete individual history entries, clear all history, and delete custom labels inside the app. Deleting the app removes its active local app data from the device. Apple-managed device backups, if enabled, are governed by Apple and your device settings.</p><h2>Permissions and purchases</h2><p>Mala does not request location, camera, microphone, contacts, or photo-library access. Version 1 has no purchase flow.</p><h2>Changes</h2><p>If Mala's data practices change, this policy and its App Store privacy disclosures will be updated before the changed behavior is released.</p>
+<h2>Contact</h2><p>Email <a href="mailto:support@priyanshchordia.com">support@priyanshchordia.com</a> for support or privacy questions.</p>
+<nav class="resource-links" aria-label="Mala legal pages">
+<a class="resource-link" href="../privacy/">Privacy policy</a>
+<a class="resource-link" href="../support/">Support</a>
+<a class="resource-link" href="../../">All app URLs</a></nav></article></section></main>
+<footer><span>priyanshchordia.com</span><span>Independent software, built with privacy in mind.</span></footer>
+</div><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebPage","name":"Mala privacy policy","url":"https://priyanshchordia.com/apps/mala/privacy/","dateModified":"2026-07-29","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"priyanshchordia.com","url":"https://priyanshchordia.com/"}}</script></body></html>
