+<meta property="og:url" content="https://priyanshchordia.com/products/svara/"><meta property="og:image" content="https://priyanshchordia.com/og-five-apps.png"><meta property="og:image:width" content="1200"><meta property="og:image:height" content="630"><meta property="og:image:alt" content="Abstract marks for the independent iOS catalogue: Mala, Anjali, Svara, Roam, Hindsight, and AuraFit."><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://priyanshchordia.com/og-five-apps.png"><meta name="twitter:image:alt" content="Abstract marks for the independent iOS catalogue: Mala, Anjali, Svara, Roam, Hindsight, and AuraFit.">
+<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"><meta name="twitter:title" content="Svara — priyanshchordia.com">
+<meta name="twitter:description" content="A local-first daily spiritual companion rooted in Hindu culture.">
+<title>Svara — priyanshchordia.com</title><link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%2032%2032'%3E%3Crect%20width='32'%20height='32'%20rx='7'%20fill='%23141414'/%3E%3Ccircle%20cx='16'%20cy='16'%20r='6'%20fill='%23d7ff4a'/%3E%3C/svg%3E" type="image/svg+xml">
+<link rel="stylesheet" href="../../styles.css?v=9883ddb311"></head>
+<body class="product-page"><a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a><div class="wrap">
+<header class="top"><div class="left">
+
+<a class="brand" href="../../index.html">P/C <span class="status" aria-hidden="true">●</span></a></div>
+<nav aria-label="Primary"><a class="active" aria-current="page" href="../../index.html#work">Work</a><a href="../../apps/">App URLs</a><a href="../../journal/">Journal</a></nav></header>
+<main id="main"><article class="product-system product-system--svara" data-app="svara">
+<header class="product-nav"><a class="product-wordmark" href="../../index.html">Priyansh Chordia <span>· iOS</span></a><nav aria-label="Product"><a href="../../index.html#work">Products</a><a href="#top">Svara</a><a href="https://apps.apple.com/app/id6785557134" rel="noopener noreferrer">App Store</a></nav></header>
+<div id="top"><section class="product-hero"><div><p class="product-kicker">Svara</p><h1>Practice. Learn. Return.</h1><p class="product-hero-body">A private daily companion for spiritual practice and cultural reconnection: short guided practices, an ordered learning path called Aaroh, and the stories behind what you already do.</p><p class="product-hero-note">Available on the App Store. No account, developer analytics, advertising, or cross-app tracking. Practice data and reflections are not sent to a developer-operated server.</p><div class="product-actions"><a class="product-button" href="https://apps.apple.com/app/id6785557134" rel="noopener noreferrer">Get Svara on the App Store</a><a href="#how-it-works">See how it works <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div></div><div class="product-motif" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><i></i><b></b></div></section>
+<section class="product-shots"><div class="product-section-heading"><p>The app</p><h2>Something to do today, and somewhere it leads.</h2></div><div class="product-shots-grid"><figure><div class="product-shot" aria-label="Today screenshot placeholder"><span>Screenshot pending</span></div><figcaption>Today</figcaption></figure><figure><div class="product-shot" aria-label="Aaroh path screenshot placeholder"><span>Screenshot pending</span></div><figcaption>Aaroh path</figcaption></figure><figure><div class="product-shot" aria-label="A practice screenshot placeholder"><span>Screenshot pending</span></div><figcaption>A practice</figcaption></figure><figure><div class="product-shot" aria-label="Stories screenshot placeholder"><span>Screenshot pending</span></div><figcaption>Stories</figcaption></figure></div></section>
+<section class="product-benefits"><div class="product-section-heading"><p>Why it exists</p><h2>Rooted, private, and possible on a normal day.</h2></div><div class="product-triad"><article><span>01</span><h3>Follow a path</h3><p>Lessons and practices create a clear next step without flattening the tradition into a checklist.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Meet the calendar</h3><p>Festival and story experiences connect practice with cultural time and context.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Keep progress local</h3><p>Practice history, points, achievements, and reflections stay on the device.</p></article></div></section>
+<section id="how-it-works" class="product-steps"><div class="product-section-heading"><p>How it works</p><h2>Four steps you will repeat.</h2></div><ol><li><span>01</span><p>Choose a practice, lesson, festival, or story.</p></li><li><span>02</span><p>Move through the experience with bundled audio where it exists.</p></li><li><span>03</span><p>Return through optional local reminders and continue your path.</p></li></ol></section>
+<section class="product-trust"><div><p>Privacy and trust</p><h2>Local-first, and made by one person.</h2><p>No account, developer analytics, advertising, or cross-app tracking. Practice data and reflections are not sent to a developer-operated server.</p><div class="product-legal-links"><a href="../../apps/svara/privacy/">Privacy notice</a><a href="../../apps/svara/support/">Support</a></div></div><aside><p>Honest boundary</p><strong>Audio is available only where bundled. Progress mechanics support orientation and are not a measure of spiritual worth.</strong></aside></section>
+<section class="product-features"><div class="product-section-heading"><p>Feature highlights</p><h2>Everything in the current public build.</h2></div><dl><div><dt>Start with today</dt><dd>01</dd></div><div><dt>Follow Aaroh at your pace</dt><dd>02</dd></div><div><dt>Read the why</dt><dd>03</dd></div><div><dt>Return when ready</dt><dd>04</dd></div><div><dt>No social feed</dt><dd>05</dd></div><div><dt>Optional purchases via StoreKit when offered</dt><dd>06</dd></div></dl></section>
+<section class="product-fit"><div class="product-section-heading"><p>Who it is for</p><h2>Especially useful if you are finding your way back.</h2></div><div><article><h3>A good fit if you</h3><p>For people seeking a culturally rooted daily companion that balances guidance, discovery, and private progress.</p></article><article><h3>Svara is deliberately not</h3><p>Audio is available only where bundled. Progress mechanics support orientation and are not a measure of spiritual worth.</p></article></div></section>
+<section id="download" class="product-waitlist"><div><p>Download</p><h2>Get Svara on the App Store.</h2><p>This page links only to the verified App Store listing for Svara. Support remains at <a href="mailto:support@priyanshchordia.com">support@priyanshchordia.com</a>.</p></div><p><a class="product-button" href="https://apps.apple.com/app/id6785557134" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open App Store listing</a></p></section>
+<section class="product-faq"><div class="product-section-heading"><p>Questions and limits</p><h2>What Svara claims, and what it does not.</h2></div><details><summary>Can I download Svara from the App Store?</summary><p>Yes. Svara has a verified App Store listing linked from this page.</p></details><details><summary>Where do privacy and support live?</summary><p>App-specific privacy and support pages are linked below when those routes are enabled. Unapproved legal copy stays noindex until owner/legal approval.</p></details><details><summary>How do I contact support?</summary><p>Email <a href="mailto:support@priyanshchordia.com">support@priyanshchordia.com</a>. Do not send private photos, credentials, or payment details.</p></details><div class="product-limits"><p>Honest limitations</p><strong>Audio is available only where bundled. Progress mechanics support orientation and are not a measure of spiritual worth.</strong></div></section>
+<footer class="product-footer"><p>More from this portfolio</p><h2>Independent iOS apps, built one at a time.</h2><div><a href="../../apps/svara/privacy/">Privacy notice</a><a href="../../apps/svara/support/">Support</a><a href="../../index.html#work">All products</a><a href="mailto:support@priyanshchordia.com">support@priyanshchordia.com</a></div><small>© 2026 Priyansh Chordia. Svara is available on the App Store.</small></footer></div></article></main>
